WEBVTT

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:03.590
The best defense is a good offense!

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:05.590
What do you mean by that, President?

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:07.960
Oh, Sugisaki's not allowed to talk.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:09.470
Put this on.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:10.970
What? Why?

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:11.960
It's a mask.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:13.970
You got to talk a lot last episode!

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.560
That's right.

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:18.220
We barely had a chance
to say anything.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.940
I was all excited because we
were getting a second season.

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:24.700
I couldn't believe we didn't

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.210
show up until the last few minutes!

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.070
Understood.

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:31.100
I just need to stay quiet, right?

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:32.750
Okay, back on topic.

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:33.990
Wait a second.

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:37.310
They still haven't gotten
a proper shot of us.

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:39.730
They didn't until the end
of the last show, either!

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:41.960
I'm getting really tired of this!

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:45.330
Okay, let's all show ourselves!

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:46.630
Go!

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:54.160
Wait a second!

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:56.980
Why are you all sparkling like that?

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.270
Okay, back on topic.

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:32.600
The best defense is a good offense.

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:34.610
Do you know what this means?

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:35.680
Yes.

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:37.410
It means that in order to level up,

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:39.340
you must hit the enemy with physical attacks.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:44.280
So we're finally ready to start
fighting the other student councils?

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:47.600
We'll have to make things so

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.750
gory they'll be forced to censor it.

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:51.390
That's not what I meant!

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:54.290
What I'm saying is that we need to
take a more offensive stance!

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:56.900
Good point, Aka-chan.

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:00.970
I've always thought
that we needed to get...

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:01.600
Physical

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:04.100
...a little more physical
in the student council.

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:05.840
That's not what I meant!

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:07.020
That's right!

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:11.670
She means "more physical" in a BL sense!

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:12.530
Boy's Love

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:15.510
That's even worse.
Boy's Love

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.980
What I'm <i>trying</i> to say is that now that

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:22.420
"Student Council's Discretion"
is getting animated again,

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:24.470
we must make the most of this opportunity

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:25.940
by going on the offensive and

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:29.060
brainstorming new ideas
for new directions!

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:31.860
New directions in episode 1?

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:33.780
The viewers will be so surprised!

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:36.260
Like I said, the best
defense is a good offense!

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:38.090
Are you sure about this?

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:40.370
I told you to shut up!

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:42.370
Look, nobody else has
a problem with it!

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.010
I'm all for new directions!

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:48.690
Mafuyu has always had things
she's wanted to say!

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:50.830
Pain that brings pleasure.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:53.020
I like it.

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:56.750
This is a hell of a way
to start a show...

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.090
Hekiyou Academy

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:01.880
Student Council Brainstorming

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:04.840
So what exactly are we going
to do for "new directions"?

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:05.360
Student Council Brainstorming

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:07.160
You haven't thought
of anything, have you?

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:09.000
That's what we're about to decide!

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:11.550
Don't you have any ideas, Sugisaki?

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:14.110
You're the one who writes the books!

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:15.910
That doesn't mean I know...

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:17.030
I can't hear you.

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:19.040
You're the one who told
me to stay quiet!

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:22.580
Try and be flexible!

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:24.250
Well, Sugisaki?

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.060
I don't know.

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:28.050
You're the one who told me to write the

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:29.920
books in the first place.

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:32.060
You shouldn't place blame on others.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:32.760
That's right.

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:34.210
Hey, wait a second.

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:35.610
I may write them, but the

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:37.260
books are just what
happens in our meetings!

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:38.670
That's right.

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:43.460
So maybe we're the ones who need a new direction.

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:44.340
I see!

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:47.140
So we start by brainstorming
our own characters.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:48.540
For instance,

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:51.880
I, Sakurano Kurimu, am the
Student Council President,

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.480
but I can also shoot lightning!

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:56.690
I'm the Vice-President, Shiina Minatsu!

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:58.990
Not only am I good at sports,

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:01.150
but I can also stretch my limbs!

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.900
I'm the secretary, Akaba Chizuru,

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:06.790
Normally I'm the brains of the group,

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:10.490
but I'm actually a pure-hearted
girl who loves her friends!

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:14.620
Shiina Mafuyu is Minatsu's little
sister and the treasurer!

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:18.260
But in reality, I'm a guy, and
a master of the blade!

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:22.310
You all just want to be someone else!

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:24.800
It's hard to come up with new ideas.

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:27.790
But our designs have changed a

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:29.780
little since last time, haven't they?

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:31.080
That's right.

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:34.690
The art design for the student
council room's changed, too.

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:38.300
Well, I'm sure there's
a good reason for that.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:42.590
Maybe we should try and
change it up even more, then!

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:44.450
That's right.

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:45.800
Like...

00:05:46.810 --> 00:05:48.510
"Student Council's Discretion."

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:54.710
A story of students struggling
to survive at school.

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:57.210
These designs are kind of ugly.

00:05:57.510 --> 00:05:59.710
This isn't a light novel.
It's a bitter one.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:01.980
A little overdramatic.

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:04.030
The character designs start to affect

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:05.720
the story when they're this different.

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:06.370
Then...

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:12.020
This is cute, but isn't
it a little childish?

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:14.990
I really don't need a
harem of preschoolers.

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:18.660
I've got it!

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:22.090
The problem isn't the
characters, it's the story!

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:25.670
I think people get bored because
it's just us sitting in

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:27.670
the student council room all day.

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:29.040
That's right.

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:31.510
We need more fights and power-ups.

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:32.960
That's right.

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:36.410
There's not even a little
BL going on here.

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:37.730
That's right.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:39.670
There hasn't been a single murder.

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:43.420
You sadistic senior, are you trying
to kill the main character?

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:44.980
Fine.

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:47.930
If that's what you think,
then I'll give you my idea.

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:51.280
Let's add a new heroine or two!

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:52.640
Go right ahead.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.640
Was that an Ostrich Club
reference just now?

00:06:56.640 --> 00:07:00.360
Seriously, if you could get
anywhere with a new heroine,

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:03.920
you wouldn't be having these problems.

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:08.170
You've barely done anything with
the characters you have here.

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:13.210
Mafuyu said she loved you,
but she also half-dumped you.

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:17.370
In a sense, you're actually worse
off than when you started.

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:21.440
Are there even any
heroines in your story?

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:26.360
It's been a while since I've seen that gag.

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:29.570
I think it's a new one for this show.

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:35.790
My heart isn't strong enough to

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:38.590
withstand many more "tsun"
remarks like that.

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:40.280
I'm sorry, Key-kun.

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:43.240
He's right. We don't do much "dere."

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:44.510
I know!

00:07:44.510 --> 00:07:46.150
If we're changing things up,

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:49.290
why not make all the girls
"dere" towards me!

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:52.420
Do you seriously think we'd
let you get away with that?

00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:53.760
"Dere," huh?

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:56.430
But that happens a lot
in sequels, doesn't it?

00:07:56.430 --> 00:08:00.420
Changing our relationships
would mix things up a bit.

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:01.400
Wouldn't it?

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:04.440
W-Well, why don't we try it?

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:07.670
Okay, you start, President!

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:09.520
Me first?

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:10.750
Go on!

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:12.440
Um, okay...

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:17.450
Jeez, don't be friendly
to any girl but me, okay?

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:20.450
Stay by Mafuyu forever!

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:23.690
I've always loved you.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:25.480
This is it!

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:28.190
Ken, I love you, too!

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:31.700
You're the only person
I feel like I can punch

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:34.100
without any reservations!

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:40.480
That's not "dere!"

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:43.450
I was trying to be cute.

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:45.640
Would kicking you've been better?

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:47.780
Why would a kick be better?

00:08:47.780 --> 00:08:51.790
Seriously, your "dere"
is worthless, isn't it?

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:53.150
That's strange.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:56.060
I was trying to be "dere."

00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:59.580
Okay, if you're really trying to be "dere,"

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:02.290
then let me hold your hand.

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:06.030
I knew you weren't trying.

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:07.200
That's not true.

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.450
I'm being very "dere."

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:10.800
See? Pat pat, rub rub.

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:13.040
Pat pat, rub rub.

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:15.820
This is definitely...

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:16.970
Dere.

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:18.710
Now I've seen what
Minatsu can really do.

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:21.680
I see... I see... Then let me, too.

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:24.820
Why?

00:09:24.820 --> 00:09:28.870
Nah, "dere" or not, I don't
want you touching me.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:31.820
I don't mind touching you, but...

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:34.360
Why is it a one way street?

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:38.560
But if you ask permission first,
maybe I'll let you.

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:39.840
I see.

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:43.310
So you need to prepare
yourself, like a maiden.

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:44.500
Well, then.

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.880
Please give me permission!

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:47.720
I want to touch you now!

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:49.210
I'm begging you!

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:50.480
He'd go that far?

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.640
He really is a freak.

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:54.840
Let's call him Ero-Saki from now on.

00:09:55.810 --> 00:09:57.350
Very well. I give my permission.

00:09:57.350 --> 00:09:58.730
Seriously?

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:01.580
So what are you giving
me permission to do?

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:02.850
You can rub them.

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:05.390
You can't mean...

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:07.680
My shoulders.

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:13.100
Honestly, I saw that coming.

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:15.230
Still, I'm enjoying this.

00:10:15.230 --> 00:10:17.700
Since you dragged it out for so long.

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:20.460
He's totally being tricked.

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:22.370
She's using her "dere" charms

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:24.380
to get him to do what she wants.

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:28.880
If her shoulders relax,
her punches will get stronger

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:31.260
and he'll just get hurt more.

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:33.250
Yeah, that's not "dere."

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:34.190
Yeah.

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:35.890
Okay, "dere" time is over.

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:37.920
N-No...

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:42.560
Okay, back to brainstorming.

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:44.260
Anybody got any ideas?

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:45.170
Yes!

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:46.180
Go, Mafuyu-chan!

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:50.220
To be honest, there haven't
been many cases where

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:53.000
an established series has done
well after trying something new.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:56.470
Like a battle series turning into a BL.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:59.940
Or a mystery series turning into a BL.

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:04.580
Or a romance series turning into a BL.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:09.600
Did any of those happen
<i>outside</i> of your head?

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:11.090
That's not the point!

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:12.680
What Mafuyu is trying to say is that

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:15.960
there's no room for this show
to go in a new direction

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:18.610
because it was built
around the idea of just

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:20.350
writing what happens in our meetings!

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:21.100
Excuse me.

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:22.470
Go, Minatsu.

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:25.340
Then why don't we do something
new with the meetings?

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:26.970
The meetings?

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:31.210
Like we could have all kinds
of embarrassing girl talks!

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:34.490
Minatsu, you just said that.

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:37.280
Even if we did that,
you wouldn't participate.

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:43.490
"Girl talk" isn't just
girls talking, you know.

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:45.520
I know that!

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:48.370
Even if <i>you</i> somehow manage,
do you really think

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:50.610
these three know how to have "girl talks"?

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:54.490
I can have girl talks, too!

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:57.850
Mafuyu doesn't just play video
games all day, you know!

00:11:57.850 --> 00:12:00.370
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:03.370
Then shall we try it?

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:06.380
Girl talk... Start!

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:17.390
Oh my... I guess I'm here first.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:26.380
Why are you patting your
face and laughing?

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:28.450
That doesn't make sense!
Your girl talk sucks, Minatsu!

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:29.330
Shut up.

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:32.310
You're early, Minatsu-san.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:34.970
I just arrived, actually.

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:39.740
Hello.

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:42.290
Hello, everyone.

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:56.460
How can you have a girl talk
when you aren't even talking?!

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:59.100
We're thinking about what to say!

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:02.530
Want me to start by getting
you something to drink?

00:13:02.530 --> 00:13:03.600
What would you like?

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.340
Strawberry milk!

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:07.870
Black coffee.

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:09.650
I'll take a Red Bull.

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:12.010
I'd like a Dr Pepper.

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:14.710
You're dropping
the act too soon!

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:17.630
Um, well then... I know!

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:18.430
British tea.

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:19.480
I'll have black tea.

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:20.780
That's right.

00:13:20.780 --> 00:13:22.710
That's very girly.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:24.350
What kind, then?

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:25.120
Kind?

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:27.080
Darjeeling? Assam?

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:31.360
You're a girl, you have to know
what kind of teas there are, right?

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:33.360
Then I'll take some darjeeling.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:36.200
Choose something I didn't suggest.

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:39.370
Key-kun, you're mean!

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:40.800
Um... Um...

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:42.240
Garam Masala!

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:43.510
Tumeric!

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:44.390
Nutmeg!

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:45.660
Black pepper!

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:50.520
We're not making curry here, guys!

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:57.400
We've only got Japanese tea
today, so I'll make that.

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:59.860
Then don't take orders!

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:03.900
Okay, let's get started.

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:06.900
What's your favorite shounen manga?

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:09.900
You're not trying to
have a girl talk at all!

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:11.260
Stop it!

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:12.400
Anything but braids!

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:13.790
What were you saying?

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:15.560
Come on, come on!

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:18.190
It's changing my character
and sapping my strength...

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:19.100
Stop it!

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:20.040
Stop it, please!

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.140
Pervert! Sexual harassment! Violence!

00:14:22.140 --> 00:14:24.210
Stop freaking out because
I played with your hair.

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:25.780
I'm disappointed in you.

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:28.170
I'll decide the theme.

00:14:28.170 --> 00:14:29.290
Love!

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:30.850
Love?

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:32.190
Let's try it.

00:14:32.190 --> 00:14:34.230
Okay then, everyone, what
kind of BL do you—

00:14:34.230 --> 00:14:35.560
Wrong!

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:39.700
You mean what kind of guys
do we like and stuff, right?

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:41.060
Something like that, yeah.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:45.070
Okay, then a boy who'll
buy me dolls and candy!

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:48.310
Someone who'll vow
his undying servitude.

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:52.540
Someone who can beat space invaders?

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:56.210
Can we make this even a
little bit girly, guys?

00:14:56.860 --> 00:15:00.310
Then why don't you do
some boy talk, Sugisaki?

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:01.090
By yourself.

00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:03.330
Why would I do something so depressing?

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:04.220
Um...

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:08.780
Why don't we think about how to gain new

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:12.100
viewers instead of changing
the existing show?

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:14.340
Gain... Hunt?

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:16.470
That's going on the offensive!

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:17.770
That's right.

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:21.240
We can't just focus on the
viewers we already have.

00:15:21.510 --> 00:15:25.100
Gaining new viewers sounds
like a better idea.

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:28.630
Yes, it's important to make it so that

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:31.480
new viewers can follow the show.

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:32.570
Yeah.

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:34.490
But what should we do?

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:37.990
Maybe we should make sure
they understand the show's goal?

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:41.990
Goal? You mean completing my harem?

00:15:41.990 --> 00:15:42.990
No!

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:46.990
That's your goal,
not the goal of the series.

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:50.760
Then tell me what the
goal of the series is!

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:52.500
It doesn't have one.

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:55.370
If we're trying to make things
easier for new viewers,

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:59.300
don't you think there are other things
we should prioritize, Aka-chan?

00:15:59.300 --> 00:16:00.900
Like what?

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:02.540
Like explaining back story.

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:04.280
Back story?

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:07.530
Is there anything to explain, really?

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.510
It's what it looks like.

00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:13.660
Us talking in the student council room.

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:18.480
That's the reason your breasts
never get bigger, Aka-chan.

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:21.900
Is that why?

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:23.530
Please don't believe that.

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:26.490
You can't ignore the back story.

00:16:26.490 --> 00:16:29.620
Altering the back story can
radically alter a show.

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:34.100
For example, Key-kun is actually
in a coma in the hospital.

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:37.790
Then this is all in my head?

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:39.820
The infamous "it was
all a dream" ending.

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:41.560
No, no.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:44.190
If we're trying to get
new viewers here,

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:47.740
can we not wreck the entire show?

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:50.070
It's a new twist that
I'm just revealing now.

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:52.200
If you know that, then who are you?

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:56.570
I am the Protean Thought
Creature CHIZURU.

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:59.570
Another shocking reveal?

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:02.360
Nobody's going to be
able to follow this.

00:17:02.360 --> 00:17:04.570
For starters, I can't even follow it.

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:06.670
Reality is cruel.

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:08.210
Okay, next idea.

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:11.950
Mafuyu has an idea she wants

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:15.220
to try for new viewers
watching this meeting.

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:16.270
What is it?

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:19.720
Why not do a reset?

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:22.330
Let's temporarily reset all the

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:27.280
friendships, love, and trust
that we've built here.

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:35.290
O-Our topic for today's meeting is,
"how to help new viewers."

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:38.140
May I say something, Sakurano-san?

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:40.080
Sakurano-san?

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.910
Sure, Chizuru, I mean...

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:43.780
Akaba-san.

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:45.690
Um... We're rewinding so

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:47.650
far back that we barely know each other?

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:49.570
Th-That's right, Sugisaki-kun.

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:51.860
May I speak?

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:53.160
Y-Yes, go ahead.

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:58.060
I'd like to say I find
today's theme a little vague.

00:17:58.060 --> 00:18:01.810
W-We'll work it out in the discussion...

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:02.780
I see.

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:04.550
Very well.

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:06.670
If that's your policy, President.

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:10.600
D-Do the Shiina sisters have any ideas?

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:12.720
I dislike that you're
lumping us together.

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:14.680
Mafuyu does, too.

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:17.390
Are you treating us like lesser people
because we're younger than you?

00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:19.890
I-I'm sorry.

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:21.450
That wasn't what I...

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:22.880
Fine, then.

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:27.100
But I don't like people
at school knowing

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:29.700
that Mafuyu the BL freak is my sister.

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:34.230
And Mafuyu doesn't
want anybody anywhere

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:37.030
knowing that this tomboy is her sister.

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:41.640
Th-Then maybe I'll suggest something...

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:43.790
Yeah. Hmm...

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:47.610
Maybe we could make what's happening
on screen easier to follow.

00:18:47.610 --> 00:18:48.850
It's settled, then.

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:52.850
Then we're finished here, yes?

00:18:52.850 --> 00:18:55.790
No, let's talk some more.

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:57.120
I'm bored.

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:59.120
Do we really have to?

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:02.480
She said she's fine doing what you want.

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:04.300
So let's do that.

00:19:04.300 --> 00:19:06.810
That's true, but...

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:09.210
Then let's move on to the next topic.

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:14.690
Everybody's being so cold!

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:17.350
Aka-chan, calm down.

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:19.310
Chizuru...

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:20.480
No glasses!

00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:21.750
Right, right. I'm sorry.

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:24.250
I didn't think she'd get so sad.

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:28.250
As the owner of this
harem, what have I done?

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:30.590
I like you all as you are!

00:19:30.590 --> 00:19:34.280
We don't have to go new
directions or get new viewers!

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:37.600
Then shall we return to our
usual meandering conversations?

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:38.370
Yes.

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:39.160
Yeah.

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:43.400
That's what "Student Council's
Discretion" is all about.

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:47.380
It's the same as the
video games I like.

00:19:47.820 --> 00:19:49.340
Like games?

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:54.190
You don't gain anything in
real life by beating a game.

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:57.180
But everyone smiles
when they play them.

00:19:57.530 --> 00:20:03.610
I think it's because there's more to
it than whether it's useful or not.

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:06.580
The student council is the same.

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:09.170
It's good because it doesn't matter.

00:20:09.620 --> 00:20:14.910
That's why Mafuyu thinks
our student council

00:20:14.910 --> 00:20:17.430
should be about nothing at all.

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:20.410
Yeah, Mafuyu-chan is right.

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:21.990
Yup.

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:23.110
Mafuyu...

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:26.420
So that's it: this is
the student council!

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:27.910
Got it, everybody?

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:31.370
With the school fair over,
there's not much left for us to do.

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:34.990
The student council
will never change!

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:39.560
But you can't depend on me
for everything forever!

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:42.060
In less than six months,
your wonderful president

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:44.300
won't be around to
take care of you!

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:47.550
Yeah.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:49.360
Even if we don't go off
in a new direction,

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:51.670
it won't be long before
we all start changing.

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:54.670
Aka-chan and I are graduating.

00:20:54.970 --> 00:20:58.940
And Mafuyu and I are transferring
at the end of the year.

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:03.180
With our mom and our new family.

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:11.690
Then I'll have to finish my harem
before we all say goodbye.

00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:13.020
What the heck?

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:16.200
Can you talk about anything
besides your harem?

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:17.240
Seriously.

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:21.720
Let's move on to the next topic, then.

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:23.970
Progress means change!

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:25.680
Doesn't that contradict everything?

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:28.610
You just said no change!

00:21:28.940 --> 00:21:34.030
But I'm graduating soon,
so I want to grow up a little!

00:21:34.030 --> 00:21:37.850
I don't wanna be someone who cries
because people are being mean!

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:40.200
You're fine as you are, Aka-chan.

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:42.210
That's not good enough!

00:21:42.210 --> 00:21:43.490
All right.

00:21:44.060 --> 00:21:48.510
Let's all think about how to
make Aka-chan more grown up.

00:21:48.510 --> 00:21:49.730
Yeah.

00:21:50.210 --> 00:21:52.790
Make her into a grown-up, huh?

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:56.070
Let's start with drinking
milk and pushups!

00:21:56.830 --> 00:22:00.340
You'll have to study
more and get smarter.

00:22:01.360 --> 00:22:03.570
I think you need to be sexier!

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:07.620
This is too hard!

00:22:07.620 --> 00:22:09.630
You're crying again.

00:22:09.630 --> 00:22:11.820
But I can't do everything at once!

00:22:11.820 --> 00:22:14.460
And that's what our student council is...
A silly, but fun slice of our daily lives.

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:15.610
President...

00:22:15.610 --> 00:22:16.100
And that's what our student council is...
A silly, but fun slice of our daily lives.

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:17.090
Sheesh.

00:22:17.090 --> 00:22:19.620
And that's what our student council is...
A silly, but fun slice of our daily lives.

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:53.700
Well?

00:23:53.700 --> 00:23:54.950
Student Council
Well?

00:23:54.950 --> 00:23:57.220
Am I more of an adult now?

00:23:57.220 --> 00:23:58.460
"Well?"

00:23:58.710 --> 00:24:01.460
You just threw two
anpan into your jacket.

00:24:01.850 --> 00:24:05.460
Did it bother you that much
that she called you flat?

00:24:05.850 --> 00:24:08.470
I didn't call her flat.

00:24:08.470 --> 00:24:09.480
Senpai.

00:24:09.480 --> 00:24:12.970
She's delicate, you need to
be more careful around her.

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:15.970
President, milk and pushups!

00:24:15.970 --> 00:24:16.790
Yeah.

00:24:20.410 --> 00:24:23.110
Start by drinking something
other than strawberry milk!

00:24:23.110 --> 00:24:24.790
Are you listening, President?
